# A repeating alert whose commands never exit: the transition's command is killed at its deadline by the wait after
# the pass, a repeat's by the wait inside the pass that made it, and the pass goes on.
database real
timeout 2
rules tests/corpus/notify/repeat.conf
exec * WARNING hang
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.n v 70
clock 1
pass 1
clock 2
pass 2
clock 3
pass 3
var loop.n v 10
clock 4
pass 4
clock 5
alarm-log 0
